      "originalText": "Every step = Step{Done(), Apply()}\n- Done() looks at the real world first\n- Apply() only if not done, then Done() again\n- every DB write carries claim_epoch\n- error -> backoff + retry; fatal ->\n  desired=ABSENT -> teardown -> FAILED\n- no DB transaction open during a\n  network call",
